################################################################################
# ENTA - public repository
#
# DENY BY DEFAULT. Everything is ignored unless a rule below explicitly
# un-ignores it. The ENTA working folder holds confidential microdata, API
# tokens, internal notes and pipeline output alongside the code, so an
# allow-list is the only structure that keeps a newly created file from
# reaching the public repo by accident. When you add a file that belongs in
# the repo, add it here too - "git add" alone will not pick it up.
#
# The repository holds everything needed to reproduce ENTA except the
# licensed microdata (EU-SILC, LFS, HBS, EUROMOD, Konsumerhebung): the code,
# the input files that cannot be downloaded from Eurostat, and the manual.
# Output - age profiles, aggregates, final data - is not stored; the code
# rebuilds it, and the published data are on Zenodo.
################################################################################

# 1. Ignore everything ...
*

# 2. ... but still descend into directories, so the rules below can match.
!*/


################################################################################
# 3. Code
################################################################################

!.gitignore
!/README.md

# Setup: path globals, the download switch, and the adjust*/control programs
# that nearly every other file calls. Run this first.
!ENTA_setup.do

# Final compilation
!ENTA_compilation1_esa.do
!ENTA_compilation2_nta.do

# Input-data preparation, age profiles, aggregates
!ENTA_input_data/*.do
!ENTA_ageprofiles/*.do
!ENTA_aggregates/*.do

# Verification of the published output, and the ledger it reads.
!ENTA_diagnostic/diagnostic_scan.R
!ENTA_diagnostic/make_nta_esa_same.R
!ENTA_diagnostic/checks.csv
!ENTA_diagnostic/identities.csv
!ENTA_diagnostic/nta_esa_same.csv
!ENTA_diagnostic/events.csv
!ENTA_diagnostic/event_scope.csv
!ENTA_diagnostic/README.md
!ENTA_diagnostic/scan_decisions.md


################################################################################
# 4. Input data that the code cannot download from Eurostat
#
# The Eurostat tables themselves are NOT stored: set the download switch in
# ENTA_setup.do and the Suppl_*.do / Aggr_ESA2010.do files fetch them.
################################################################################

# World Bank CPI (manual download) and DG TAXUD tax revenue by function
!ENTA_input_data/Original_input_data/CPI_world_bank.xls
!ENTA_input_data/Original_input_data/taxud_tax_ec_func_en.csv

# UN World Population Prospects - the API needs a personal token
!ENTA_input_data/Original_input_data/population_UN.dta

# Public health profile from the 2018 Ageing Report; the code that builds it
# is not published
!ENTA_input_data/ENTA_input_datasets/CGH_AWG.dta

# Tax shares derived from EUROMOD (country x year aggregates, no microdata)
!ENTA_input_data/ENTA_input_datasets/taxr.dta
!ENTA_input_data/ENTA_input_datasets/inctax_nonempl_decomp.dta


################################################################################
# 5. Manual - the PDF only, not its LaTeX sources
################################################################################

!2026_ENTA_Manual_V_2_0_0/Manual.pdf


################################################################################
# 6. Never share - restated, so the intent survives any edit above
#
# Deny-by-default already excludes all of this. These rules only name what
# must never be un-ignored. Do NOT add a folder here that section 3-5 opens
# (e.g. "ENTA_input_data/Original_input_data/"): git cannot re-include a file
# from an excluded folder, so the allow rules above would silently stop
# working.
################################################################################

# Machine-specific setup
ENTA_setup_TU.do

# Credentials
token_population_data.txt
**/un_api_token.txt

# Output (rebuilt by the code, published on Zenodo). Contents only, not the
# folders: each keeps its README.md so a fresh clone has the folder, and git
# cannot re-include a file from an excluded folder.
ENTA_output_data/*
!ENTA_output_data/README.md
ENTA_ageprofiles/ageprofiles/*
!ENTA_ageprofiles/ageprofiles/README.md
ENTA_aggregates/*.dta

# Not published: health source data and the code that builds CGH_AWG
ENTA_data_other/

# Internal working notes
CLAUDE.md
ENTA_bug_report.txt
ENTA_todo.txt
ENTA_todo_next_version.txt
ENTA_next_session.md
TX_residual_review.md

# Editor / OS byproducts
.claude/
desktop.ini
*.log
*.stswp
~*.stswp
